# Everything the build does not need. Without this the whole node_modules tree
# and every build artefact is sent to the daemon as context, which is slow and
# can silently overwrite the image's own install.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
e2e/test-results
e2e/playwright-report
docs
*.md
!README.md
